 { By now, you would have learnt almost everything you need for calculation mastery. However, using only the techniques from earlier chapters may not be sufficient to handle a small set of quirky endgame positions. Right now, this is the only chink in the armour. Hence, I have designed this chapter to equip you with new motifs and techniques to deal with these positions. Without further ado, let’s get started on the first one. }  
